#: src/Admin/Pages/AboutPage.php:2581
msgid "<code>ok === false</code> covers three genuinely different situations, distinguishable by the other fields: nothing was recorded (<code>submissionId</code> empty — a missing <code>form_name</code>, an excluded form, an insert failure), or it was recorded and some delivery failed (<code>failedDeliveries</code> non-empty), or it was recorded with nothing to deliver."
