#: src/Admin/Pages/AboutPage.php:2592
msgid "<strong><code>convermetry_submission_recorded</code> fires</strong> — notifications queue here, and listeners run even with no webhook endpoints configured."
msgstr ""

#: src/Admin/Pages/AboutPage.php:2593
msgid "<strong>Delivery</strong>: queued for the background worker (action), or dispatched synchronously to every form endpoint (function)."
