#: src/Admin/Pages/AboutPage.php:2594
msgid "Duplicate protection is the same as for bundled providers: a repeated <code>cvm_conversion_id</code> hits the <code>UNIQUE conversion_id</code> index, and the second call reports success <strong>without recording or delivering anything twice</strong>."
