msgid "Records a custom server-side analytics event. <code>$type</code> is at most 20 characters of lowercase letters, digits, dashes and underscores; recognized <code>$data</code> keys are the event row's own columns and unknown keys are ignored. A <code>form_success</code> event <strong>requires</strong> <code>event_value</code> to be a unique conversion id (8–100 chars of <code>A-Za-z0-9_.:-</code>), so conversion dedup stays consistent."
